        <mxCell id="wb" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#7A6000;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Starting at Layer 4 because it sounds the most dramatic. Start at Layer 1. Hash pinning is the fastest to implement, catches the most common attack vectors, and creates the baseline integrity record that all other layers depend on. Layer 4 without Layer 1 is a format migration that cannot verify its own output." vertex="1">
